rumal</p>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"https://games.ayyamperumal.online/\"\n        class=\"text-purple-400 font-bold hover:text-purple-300 transition flex items-center gap-2\">\n        View All Games\n        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n          <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3\" />\n        </svg>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n\n      <div\n        class=\"group bg-[#111] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/5 hover:border-purple-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2\">\n        <div class=\"aspect-video overflow-hidden\">\n          <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509228468518-180dd4864904?q=80&w=600&auto=format\" alt=\"Sudoku Master\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-5\">\n          <span class=\"text-[10px] text-purple-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\">Puzzle</span>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mt-1\">Sudoku Elite</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm mt-2 line-clamp-2\">A minimalist and high-performance take on the classic logic\n            puzzle.</p>\n          <button class=\"w-full mt-4 py-2 bg-white/5 hover:bg-purple-600 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold transition-colors\">Launch Game</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div\n        class=\"group bg-[#111] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/5 hover:border-purple-500/50 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2\">\n        <div class=\"aspect-video overflow-hidden\">\n          <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552820728-8b83bb6b773f?q=80&w=600&auto=format\" alt=\"Neon Racer\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform du